			"notes": "Stability and settings refinement.\n\n- Switches tools before mining, block-use, and attack actions, including one-click actions.\n- Prevents duplicate carried-slot packets and pauses switching while a game screen is open.\n- Refines Mod Menu settings into a Quick Start path with advanced controls available when needed.\n- Hardens config loading and saves, and enforces the Fabric API minimum dependency.\n- Supports Minecraft 26.1 through 26.2."
		},
