			"notes": "## Stage\nBeta / prerelease.\n\n## Fix\n- Added a one-time restart request token so only `/restart` can authorize a relaunch.\n- `/shutdown` now cancels any pending restart request before stopping the server.\n- Prevents stale relauncher processes from making a later shutdown look like a restart.\n\n## Notes\nThis build keeps the CurseForge-safe direct Java relaunch model from 1.2.1. It does not execute shell commands, batch files, shell scripts, or free-form launch command strings.\n\n## Requirements\n- Minecraft 26.1, 26.1.1, 26.1.2, or 26.2\n- Fabric Loader 0.19.3+\n- Fabric API\n- Java 25+"
		},
