			"notes": "## Stage\nBeta / prerelease. This adds new command and warning configuration behavior. Windows restart handoff was previously tested; `/shutdown`, action-bar warnings, and Linux/macOS paths still need live validation before Stable/Release.\n\n## Changes\n- Added `/shutdown` and `/shutdown <delay_seconds>` to stop the server without relaunching.\n- Added configurable player warnings with `warningIndicator=chat`, `actionbar`, or `both`.\n- Added configurable `warningColor`.\n- Added configurable restart/shutdown warning, scheduled, and final messages.\n- Added `{seconds}`, `{second_word}`, and `{operation}` placeholders.\n- Existing config files are backfilled with new keys on startup.\n\n## Requirements\n- Minecraft 26.1, 26.1.1, 26.1.2, or 26.2\n- Fabric Loader 0.19.3+\n- Fabric API\n- Java 25+"
